---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Geothermal Heat Pump" description="Thermodynamic modeling of a year-round geothermal heat pump cycle." currentPage="/projects">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Course Project · Thermodynamics</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Geothermal Heat Pump Design</h1>
      <p class="hero__subtitle">
        Selected a refrigerant and modeled a year-round geothermal cycle in EES for a
        12.3 kW thermal load.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="card fade-in" style="border-left:4px solid var(--accent); margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><strong>Course:</strong> Thermodynamics</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><strong>Type:</strong> Individual project</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0;"><strong>Tool:</strong> Engineering Equation Solver (EES)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="placeholder fade-in" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
        <!-- Replace with: cycle diagram, EES screenshot, or schematic -->
        <span>Cycle diagram or EES model screenshot (800×400)</span>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in">
        <h2>Problem</h2>
        <p>
          Design a geothermal heat pump system capable of providing both heating and cooling
          for a 12.3 kW thermal load throughout the year. Select an appropriate refrigerant
          and model the full thermodynamic cycle.
        </p>

        <h2>Approach</h2>
        <p>
          I evaluated five candidate refrigerants on thermodynamic performance, environmental
          impact (GWP, ODP), and safety classification. <strong>R-32</strong> was selected for
          its favorable balance of high COP, low GWP, and good volumetric capacity.
        </p>
        <p>
          The full vapor-compression cycle was modeled in <strong>EES</strong> (Engineering
          Equation Solver) with realistic component efficiencies and ground-source temperature
          profiles for year-round operation.
        </p>

        <h2>Results</h2>
        <ul style="padding-left:1.25rem; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Heating COP:</strong> 4.30</li>
          <li><strong>Cooling COP:</strong> 1.83</li>
          <li><strong>Design load:</strong> 12.3 kW</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Tools</h2>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem; margin-top:0.5rem;">
          <span class="card__tag">EES</span>
          <span class="card__tag">Thermodynamics</span>
          <span class="card__tag">Refrigerant Selection</span>
          <span class="card__tag">Energy Systems</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:3rem;">
        <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--outline">← All Projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
